  OWASP_Application_Security_Verification_Standard_5.0.0_en.flat.json
    The release's machine-readable requirement list, unmodified. PROVENANCE.json
    records its tag, commit, path and SHA-256.
  LICENSE.md
    The CC BY-SA 4.0 license text shipped at the same tag, unmodified.
  owasp-asvs-l1.json
    An adaptation: the Level 1 rows of the file above with their upstream
    identifiers and requirement text unchanged, annotated with MoonMind's
    evidence classification and OWASP Top 10:2025 mappings. It is generated by
    tools/build_asvs_pack.py and is licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.
  PROVENANCE.json
    Inputs and output digests of that build.

